{"seq":1,"slug":"lobby-matchmaker-handoff","title":"大厅与匹配衔接：票据提交、状态轮询与服务器分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/matchmaking/lobby-matchmaker-handoff","wordCount":843,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"大厅与匹配衔接-票据提交-状态轮询与服务器分配\">大厅与匹配衔接：票据提交、状态轮询与服务器分配</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Match Ticket</strong></td>\n<td>大厅向匹配系统提交的标准数据包，携带参与玩家信息和匹配约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Open Match</strong></td>\n<td>Google 开源匹配框架，提供 Ticket CRUD + Match Function + Director 三层架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>GameServerAllocation</strong></td>\n<td>Agones 接口，原子性地将一个 Ready 状态的服务器切换为 Allocated</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Join Token</strong></td>\n<td>大厅颁发给玩家的一次性凭证，游戏服务器验证合法连接用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Director</strong></td>\n<td>Open Match 中负责调用 Match Function 并触发服务器分配的编排组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>指数退避（Exponential Backoff）</strong></td>\n<td>服务器分配失败时，以 5s/10s/20s 递增间隔重试，避免惊群</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"大厅与匹配系统的职责边界\">大厅与匹配系统的职责边界</h2><p>大厅（Lobby）和匹配（Matchmaker）是两个独立的系统：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大厅</strong>：管理玩家聚集、房间状态、游戏前的社交交互；不决定&quot;谁和谁玩&quot;（匹配系统的职责）</li>\n<li><strong>匹配</strong>：根据技能分、等待时间等因素将玩家分组；不管理玩家的实时连接状态（大厅的职责）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者的交接点是：当大厅中的玩家准备好游戏，大厅服务向匹配系统提交<strong>匹配票据（Match Ticket）</strong>，匹配完成后获得<strong>游戏服务器地址</strong>，最终通知玩家连接游戏服务器。</p>\n<p>两种典型场景：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>大厅内匹配</strong>：玩家先组好 Party 进入大厅，再从大厅发起匹配（LOL、DOTA 2 风格）</li>\n<li><strong>匹配池模式</strong>：玩家直接进入匹配队列，匹配完成后自动进入大厅（战地、Apex 风格）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本文聚焦场景 1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"匹配票据-match-ticket-设计\">匹配票据（Match Ticket）设计</h2><p>票据是大厅向匹配系统传递&quot;我要开始游戏&quot;的标准化数据包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type MatchTicket struct {&#10;    TicketID    string          `json:&quot;ticket_id&quot;`    // 唯一 ID&#10;    LobbyRoomID string          `json:&quot;lobby_room_id&quot;` // 来源房间&#10;    Mode        string          `json:&quot;mode&quot;`          // 游戏模式（ranked / casual / custom）&#10;    Region      string          `json:&quot;region&quot;`        // 首选地区&#10;    Players     []TicketPlayer  `json:&quot;players&quot;`       // 参与玩家信息&#10;    Teams       []TicketTeam    `json:&quot;teams&quot;`         // 预定的队伍分配（Party 内已定好）&#10;    Constraints MatchConstraints `json:&quot;constraints&quot;`  // 匹配约束&#10;    CreatedAt   time.Time       `json:&quot;created_at&quot;`&#10;    ExpiresAt   time.Time       `json:&quot;expires_at&quot;`    // 票据有效期（通常 10 分钟）&#10;}&#10;&#10;type TicketPlayer struct {&#10;    PlayerID   string  `json:&quot;player_id&quot;`&#10;    MMR        float64 `json:&quot;mmr&quot;`          // 技能分（用于匹配算法）&#10;    Platform   string  `json:&quot;platform&quot;`&#10;    PingRegions map[string]int `json:&quot;ping_regions&quot;` // 各地区 Ping 值&#10;}&#10;&#10;type MatchConstraints struct {&#10;    MaxMMRDelta     float64 `json:&quot;max_mmr_delta&quot;`       // 技能分最大差距&#10;    CrossPlatform   bool    `json:&quot;cross_platform&quot;`      // 是否允许跨平台&#10;    PreferredRegion string  `json:&quot;preferred_region&quot;`&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MatchTicket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    TicketID    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          `json:\"ticket_id\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 唯一 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    LobbyRoomID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          `json:\"lobby_room_id\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 来源房间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Mode        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          `json:\"mode\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 游戏模式（ranked / casual / custom）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Region      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          `json:\"region\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 首选地区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Players     []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TicketPlayer</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  `json:\"players\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 参与玩家信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Teams       []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TicketTeam</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    `json:\"teams\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 预定的队伍分配（Party 内已定好）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Constraints </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MatchConstraints</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `json:\"constraints\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 匹配约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CreatedAt   </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       `json:\"created_at\"`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ExpiresAt   </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       `json:\"expires_at\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 票据有效期（通常 10 分钟）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TicketPlayer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PlayerID   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  `json:\"player_id\"`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MMR        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float64</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `json:\"mmr\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 技能分（用于匹配算法）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Platform   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  `json:\"platform\"`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PingRegions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `json:\"ping_regions\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 各地区 Ping 值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MatchConstraints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MaxMMRDelta     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float64</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `json:\"max_mmr_delta\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 技能分最大差距</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CrossPlatform   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    `json:\"cross_platform\"`</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 是否允许跨平台</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PreferredRegion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  `json:\"preferred_region\"`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"票据提交与状态轮询\">票据提交与状态轮询</h2><h3 id=\"open-match-google-开源匹配框架-集成\">Open Match（Google 开源匹配框架）集成</h3><p>Open Match 是目前主流的开源匹配框架，提供标准化的 API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[大厅服务]                [Open Match Frontend]&#10;    │                           │&#10;    │── CreateTicket(ticket) ──&gt;│&#10;    │&lt;── ticket_id ─────────────│&#10;    │                           │&#10;    │── GetTicket(ticket_id) ──&gt;│  （轮询，每 2 秒一次）&#10;    │&lt;── {status: &quot;pending&quot;} ───│&#10;    │                           │&#10;    │── GetTicket(ticket_id) ──&gt;│&#10;    │&lt;── {status: &quot;matched&quot;,    │&#10;    │     assignment: {         │&#10;    │       connection: &quot;ip:port&quot;,│&#10;    │       extensions: {...}   │&#10;    │     }}                    │\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[大厅服务]                [Open Match Frontend]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │                           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │── CreateTicket(ticket) ──>│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │&#x3C;── ticket_id ─────────────│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │                           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │── GetTicket(ticket_id) ──>│  （轮询，每 2 秒一次）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │&#x3C;── {status: \"pending\"} ───│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │                           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │── GetTicket(ticket_id) ──>│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │&#x3C;── {status: \"matched\",    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │     assignment: {         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │       connection: \"ip:port\",│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │       extensions: {...}   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │     }}                    │</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 提交票据&#10;func (ls *LobbyService) submitMatchTicket(room *Room) (string, error) {&#10;    ticket := buildTicket(room)&#10;&#10;    resp, err := ls.omClient.CreateTicket(ctx, &amp;pb.CreateTicketRequest{&#10;        Ticket: &amp;pb.Ticket{&#10;            Id: ticket.TicketID,&#10;            Extensions: mustMarshalAny(ticket),&#10;        },&#10;    })&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        return &quot;&quot;, fmt.Errorf(&quot;create ticket: %w&quot;, err)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 将 ticketID 存入房间状态，用于后续查询和取消&#10;    room.MatchTicketID = resp.Id&#10;    return resp.Id, nil&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 轮询状态（每 2 秒，最多等 10 分钟）&#10;func (ls *LobbyService) pollMatchStatus(ctx context.Context, room *Room) {&#10;    ticker := time.NewTicker(2 * time.Second)&#10;    defer ticker.Stop()&#10;&#10;    timeout := time.After(10 * time.Minute)&#10;&#10;    for {&#10;        select {&#10;        case &lt;-ticker.C:&#10;            ticket, err := ls.omClient.GetTicket(ctx, &amp;pb.GetTicketRequest{Id: room.MatchTicketID})&#10;            if err != nil {&#10;                continue // 短暂网络错误，继续轮询&#10;            }&#10;            if ticket.Assignment != nil {&#10;                ls.onMatchFound(room, ticket.Assignment)&#10;                return&#10;            }&#10;            // 广播等待进度给大厅玩家&#10;            room.broadcast(MatchSearchingEvent{&#10;                ElapsedSeconds: int(time.Since(room.MatchStartedAt).Seconds()),&#10;            })&#10;&#10;        case &lt;-timeout:&#10;            ls.onMatchTimeout(room)&#10;            return&#10;&#10;        case &lt;-ctx.Done():&#10;            ls.omClient.DeleteTicket(ctx, &amp;pb.DeleteTicketRequest{Id: room.MatchTicketID})&#10;            return&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1